OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to demolish 'eyesore' pub
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to demolish an "eyesore" pub and
OL,7,Freplace it with affordable homes have
OL,8,Fbeen approved.
OL,10,FThe former Nautical William pub in
OL,11,FWigston, Leicestershire, was left empty
OL,12,Fafter going out of business five years
OL,13,Fago.
OL,15,FPeople in the area have voiced concerns
OL,16,Fabout the state of the building, which
OL,17,Fhas been a hotspot for antisocial
OL,18,Fbehaviour.
OL,20,FOadby and Wigston Borough Council has
OL,21,Fnow approved plans to tear the building
OL,22,Fdown and build 14 affordable homes.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
